# Title: Potential Suspicious Winget Package Installation
# ID: a3f5c081-e75b-43a0-9f5b-51f26fe5dba2
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-04-18
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.stealth
# Description: Detects potential suspicious winget package installation from a suspicious source.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Contents="[ZoneTransfer]  ZoneId=3*" AND (Contents CONTAIN "://1" OR Contents CONTAIN "://2" OR Contents CONTAIN "://3" OR Contents CONTAIN "://4" OR Contents CONTAIN "://5" OR Contents CONTAIN "://6" OR Contents CONTAIN "://7" OR Contents CONTAIN "://8" OR Contents CONTAIN "://9") AND TargetFilename="*:Zone.Identifier" AND TargetFilename CONTAIN "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\WinGet\\")
